<title>USA: LaserSight retains A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>LaserSight retains A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaserSight Inc said Wednesday that it has engaged the investment banking firm of A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons to explore and evaluate strategic business opportunities.</p>
<p>The company said its two divisions, consisting of Technologies and Health Care Services, have demonstrable strengths. However, the company said it believes the financial community does not fully recognize the long-term value of the combination of its technology and managed care strategies.</p>
<p>For that reason, the company said it engaged A.G. Edwards to explore and pursue opportunities to maximize shareholder value.</p>
</text>
